Red Hat Display  (OFL-1.1)  — Regular, Medium and Bold, version 1.030.
  Copyright 2021 The Red Hat Project Authors (OFL.txt); the fonts' own name table
  reads Copyright 2024 The Red Hat Project Authors. Upstream:
  https://github.com/RedHatOfficial/RedHatFont at commit 6bb1048
  (fonts/Proportional/RedHatDisplay/ttf/). Upstream states the license as the SIL
  Open Font License 1.1 with Reserved Font Name "Red Hat".
  Tether ships the three upstream TTF files unchanged, with no subset, under
  src/tether/gui/assets/brand/fonts/, with the upstream OFL.txt beside them (see
  also LICENSES/OFL-1.1.txt and the REUSE.toml annotation). The documentation
  site carries unchanged copies of Medium and Bold, with the same OFL.txt, under
  docs/assets/fonts/ for its headings. The word mark in the
  brand files is Red Hat Display Bold converted to outlines; no brand file loads
  a font. scripts/brand/README.md records the SHA-256 of each font file.

